{"sections":[{"slug":"Abel范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Abel范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Abel 范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">模范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">可能非交换</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">环</span> $R$, <span lang=\"zh\">左</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">右</span>) $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模范畴是</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是小范畴</span>, $\\mathsf A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么函子范畴</span> $\\mathsf {Fun}(C,A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若进一步</span> $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Ab-范畴","text":"Ab-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathsf A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的加性函子也构成</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个对象的</span> $\\mathsf {Ab}$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即一个环</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathsf {Ab}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的加性函子的范畴即为左模范畴</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $\\mathsf C$ <span lang=\"zh\">换成对偶范畴即得右模范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Ab-范畴","text":"Ab-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}